    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=viDmXaiaC23yBh98]], any creature that starts its turn in a [[lookup @target.template.size activity=viDmXaiaC23yBh98]]-foot Emanation originating from the swarm. <em>Failure:</em> The target has the &amp;Reference[Poisoned apply=false] condition until the start of its next turn. While Poisoned, the target can take either an action or a Bonus Action on its turn, not both, and it can’t take Reactions.</p>",
